  "name": "Trip Attack",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/movement/feet-spurred-boots-brown.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with an attack roll using a weapon or an Unarmed Strike, you can expend one Superiority Die and add the die to the attack's damage roll. If the target is Large or smaller, it must succeed on a Strength saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[Prone] condition.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-QeXYRpr665AxyLvo\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature will automatically use the higher of your Strength/Dexterity for the save.</p><p>The Damage included in the save allows you to select the type of damage it should deal in the roll dialog. It will remember your choice going forwards.</p></section>",
